Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:40.23,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's been a year already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:41.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.28,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's like magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:45.88,def2,Maybe,0,0,0,,Maybe it is magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.18,0:01:50.59,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Oceans, skies... Earth did recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:58.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,But sometimes I wonder if it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.78,0:02:04.68,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,In this vast universe, we happened\N to meet, and now we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:11.12,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Why don't we believe that\N we're both part of this miracle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:14.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{konoumi}Like these oceans and skies...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.96,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,...we're together because it's meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:19.96,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:22.04,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.43,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Nothing. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:26.09,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Are you alright ? \NYou don't look...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:28.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm just relieved after seeing\N your face after so many days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:40.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,So it's true that Mori doesn't remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.61,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,She lost her memories of the past 4 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:46.79,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,She's cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:10.33,def2,TAKUMA,0,0,0,,There you are, Team Ginga.{alaxy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:13.43,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,How is the Antares group doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:15.93,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard the Yamato,\N the place we call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:22.58,def2,TAKUMA,0,0,0,,It's a miracle that all the aerial squadrons\N remained intact during such a dire situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.28,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,How was the Ginga ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:28.08,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,We didn't really belong there{have any place} since{because}\N most of its spacecraft are unmanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:31.14,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,So, what do you think of the attacker ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.88,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,It's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:36.98,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,Smaller turning radius,\N lower turret motion rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.81,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,It's so easy to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.18,def2,SAWAMURA,0,0,0,,It's a bit tight inside, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:43.13,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Then, you'll always be the gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:46.18,def2,TAKUMA,0,0,0,,Hey, Shino, how's Commander Kato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.61,0:03:52.47,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Now that we're all here, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:27.53,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,I lost the command A.I.,\N on top of the Cosmo Reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:30.41,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,At this moment, \Nwe can't proceed with Plan G.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Because of that, we'll transfer \Nsome equipment to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:36.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The Ginga will stay here and prepare for the next...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:39.14,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}That's good enough, Captain Todo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:46.17,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I have some questions on how the command A.I. was destroyed, but this is wartime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:49.78,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{genba}I need to let the field officers make decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.68,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:05:00.98,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Soon, Earth will have to\N fight a decisive battle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:04.26,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{koushite}This could be the last time we talk like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.98,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I couldn't do anything for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:13.56,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}...but if we could meet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.36,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Chief...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:24.00,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Father, I feel like \NI understand Mother a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:33.22,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Humans set goals{vision} because\N of weak and fragile minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:43.14,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,I've been thinking I'd be better off keeping\Na closed mind if it became a burden, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:47.92,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,It's fate that you met him on Telesart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:48.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,My Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:52.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...Abelt Desler was not a crazy dictator.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:58.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Planet Garmillas is dying,\N but he had to keep it secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.50,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{minzoku}He cared about the future \Nof our people{race} more than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.45,0:06:05.57,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{sorega}I was able to learn that, so this assignment...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:06.79,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Happy about it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:14.73,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Are you going then ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.83,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I'd like your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:19.33,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,This is a tough time for Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.33,0:06:24.50,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{onaji}We have to find a new home with a similar \Nenvironment for the entire population to migrate to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:32.21,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{sono}I don't want to lose a talent who's suitable for the difficult task, but having seen your face...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:36.28,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{kawaiku}You've lost your edge, Klaus.\N Are you in love ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:37.39,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:45.93,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,I've realized that this weak and fragile \Nmind is what makes humans human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:52.76,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Fickle and uncertain, but rational at times. {text: Activate}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:49.73,Karaoke Translation op,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\pos(942,232)\c&H00AEFF&\3c&H000000&}Activate
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:57.53,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,All useable parts on the \NGinga have been transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.05,0:07:04.34,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,You're not going to say \NI'm the most needed, are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.18,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,You're not going with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.78,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Pops...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:13.26,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,There's so much left for you to teach those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:18.53,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Train them to be skilled engineers,{gfurnace keepers,h} Yamazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:23.41,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,That's human nature, which \Ncan't be replaced with machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:32.67,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{tokini}It's the source of our unique power, which is \Nso strong that we can actually hurt ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:39.95,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Hijikata, you were right about\N the wave motion gun fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{chikara}...and overconfidence with power. In the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:52.07,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I just spoke for Okita. It was you who had \Nthe practical insight about Earth's future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:58.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,But I couldn't see the future, and that\Nis what's at stake in the next battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:01.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We have a real challenge ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.60,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You and I, as well as all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:29.23,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,No matter what the future holds,\N I want to be human until the very last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:49.03,def2,TSUBASA,0,0,0,,Everyone's leaving the hospital ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:58.78,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Yes. Let's get back to Earth and prepare\N to welcome Dad and his friends home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:06.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The 248th fleet has departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:09.57,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It'll coordinate with the advanced fleet \Nto form the second defense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.23,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,You only need to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:16.90,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,As long as we have the Time Fault, \NEarth's war potential is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.65,0:09:19.53,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:27.23,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Not just Tsubasa, but many other kids \Nwith the same illness have been saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:29.03,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,You should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:31.48,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,I can't. Treason is treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:38.59,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Don't give me that face, Shino. \NEveryone accepted me without saying a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.48,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{kari}I can't die until I repay my debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:45.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The enemy defense is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:49.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{ginga}We lost the Ginga's wave motion amplifier...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:55.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...so neither Earth nor Garmillas has the necessary firepower to break through, except for...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Transit wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:58.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:03.66,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The Transit wave motion gun may be able to \Nbreak through the defense field of the comet city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:09.69,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We aim at this location, and then open a\N path to enter the heart of enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:18.18,def2,SANaDA,0,0,0,,{kesshi}Our taskforce will target Gatlantis's\N Achilles heel, which is Zorder's throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.08,def2,SANaDA,0,0,0,,That's Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:25.14,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Katsuragi Touko told me just \Nbefore she passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:31.53,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{wareware}We'll activate Golem and destroy all of Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:33.08,def2,SHINOHARA,0,0,0,,Total annihilation...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:35.63,def2,KURATA,0,0,0,,They're not human. Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:37.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,One more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:42.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Can we talk to Zorder one more time ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:45.66,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:50.20,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Maybe we can seize Golem \Nand use it as a bargaining chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:54.18,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,You're too naive !\N Have you forgotten what Gatlantis has done ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.94,0:10:56.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.83,0:10:59.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...but now I know their history...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:02.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,...and Zorder's past...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:09.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I don't think I can convince a person who's been in despair for a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:11.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:17.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:20.44,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,If you find a chance, don't waste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.81,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,But you must remember your limits.{know how far you should go.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:25.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.65,0:11:34.69,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Are you alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.54,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:41.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,He stood up alone against everyone.{'s opposition ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:44.33,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,That's how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.38,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,And you fell in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:53.86,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone who is so deeply\N in love with each other like you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.32,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,I just wanted you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.33,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Say what ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:07.86,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Space Cavalry will be excluded from this operation. That's the Captain's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.50,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Pops, explain why !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:11.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Stop, Saito !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.72,0:12:15.47,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,There are other spies on board besides Katsuragi Touko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:18.60,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{korewa}From Kato's testimony, it appears to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.26,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Space Cavalry was rescued from the 11th Planet, which makes you guys the highest risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.57,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to put my faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.57,0:12:28.30,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\i1}What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:30.30,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\i1}You owe me one, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:40.26,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Once Touko regains consciousness, \Nwe should be able to ask, but until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:41.78,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{Tell me...tell me how to \Nbreak free from the puppeteer}Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:44.41,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,...tell me, how does one break\N free from the puppeteer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:51.20,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Garmillas has taken some Gatlantian hostages.\N There must be a way to prevent self detonation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:55.82,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,There's only one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:15.53,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:19.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Captain Hijikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:39.78,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Once the Yamato's destruction is confirmed, \Nwe'll arrange a new home for Garmillas to migrate to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:44.13,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Exactly the same environment as your dying planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:50.28,def2,MIL,0,0,0,,No matter how vast the universe is, \Nonly Gatlantis can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:06.87,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Keyman ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I can't see anything. \NNo abnormality in the external sensors, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:14.47,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I'm positive.\N It was brief, but that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:20.07,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,A man who values honor more than \Nanyone won't take deceptive actions...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.74,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Desler is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:29.78,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We must end any \Ndoubt once and for all !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:32.04,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare to warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:38.38,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Yamato means great harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:40.42,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Your ideals may be beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:45.65,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}However, ideals can't save anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:15:00.53,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If your ideals can change this reality, \Nthen come get me, Ranhalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:09.66,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Did we get it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.60,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,This close...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.34,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Core ship, emergency separation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.38,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Enemy ship separated !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.16,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:26.81,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Prepare for reverse thrust !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:27.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:30.06,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Crash into it !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:48.03,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,No enemy contact, except \Nfor one, the Neues Deusula !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:50.70,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,No engine signature from the separated vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:53.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Space Cavalry platoon, prepare for take off !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:57.43,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}All hands, use B configuration !\N Prepare for hand-to-hand combat !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:01.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Chief Tactical Officer Kodai will lead \NTeam Bravo and storm the enemy ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.64,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Lieutenant Keyman will manage the timing !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.42,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.29,0:16:11.43,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,No response at all. \NIt's likely unmanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.43,0:16:12.21,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:16.01,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Interference in the aft wave motion shield !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:21.78,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,The wave motion shield has\N weakened and is partially breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:27.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The armor has been damaged, and several small mobile Gatlantis weapons have entered the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:31.23,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Team Alpha, guard the interior of the ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.47,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Also from ahead !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:39.68,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Detaching the core ship in exchange \Nfor stopping the Yamato's movement...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:42.88,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Excellent split-second decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:47.73,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,It's almost like you knew the \NYamato would crash into our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.43,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:56.73,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...but family members tend to have similar ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:02.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Turning left at the next corner !\N The defense will be tough !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.20,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Got it !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:21.55,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,What's the enemy status inside the ship ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:25.93,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Their numbers are dwindling.\N Commander Saito's Team Alpha is fighting well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:29.08,def2,KURATA,0,0,0,,I just guided all the hostiles to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:30.98,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Got it. \NLeave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:34.83,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nagakura, when they touch\N the trap, aim for the elbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:35.58,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Got it !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:50.36,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.10,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nagakura !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.37,0:17:59.25,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Damn, no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:05.86,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Commander ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:06.94,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Beats me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.07,0:18:28.52,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}They need love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:33.87,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}They need love after all. How pitiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.13,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}{zetsubo}Know what despair is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:40.74,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Don't tell me I...I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:50.41,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Commander...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.21,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:06.65,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:19.96,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You kill each other without knowing \Nthat you're just being toyed with by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.63,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Know what despair is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:27.94,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Kill everyone, \Nburn everything down, then go extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.19,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{sorega}That's how humans are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.49,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,They need love after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:41.53,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Not the kind of love to preserve the species.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:45.23,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{kioku}Not the kind of love that'll fade away \Nbecause of a mere memory problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:50.18,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,But love that will end this suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:57.88,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Death will bring eternal peace to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:59.92,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That's the greatest love of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:13.86,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,They are puppets after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:15.78,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,The control room's been breached ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:19.09,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Why can't they eliminate such\N a small number of rats ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:26.08,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Führer, His Highness Ranhalt\N knows everything about this ship.{very well about the ship.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:30.36,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Your word was not to interfere \Nwith your family matters, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:33.53,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I don't remember changing my order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:36.63,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}But at this rate, you'll be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.43,def2,TALAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Let us send you a rescue team...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:43.36,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That was faster than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:45.47,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Führer, stop the fight at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:49.58,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You're using Gatlantis to save your people...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:51.17,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...aren't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:56.97,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If so, why did you send me a signal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:03.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Zorder's objective is to \Nexterminate all human life in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:07.35,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{tatoe}Even if he keeps his promise,\N they can never coexist with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:12.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{teo}Deep down, you know\N you should ally with Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:13.46,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:19.41,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The salvation you achieved in the small \Nenvironment on the Yamato was trivial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:21.52,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Führer...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:26.40,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:27.84,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:31.62,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Führer !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:46.56,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Klaus Keyman, kill Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.19,0:21:50.96,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,If you do, I'll spare both Earth and Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:58.26,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Time doesn't mean anything to clones like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:04.26,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,I wonder how many centuries it'd take \Nto exterminate the entire human race...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:11.51,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Do as I say, and you'll gain a 10,000 year extension.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:18.83,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Now kill Desler, an object of your love !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:43.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 22
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:43.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(246,1040)}Destined Duel !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:18.63,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Cottony clouds drift high across the sky\N{\i1}Sora takaku nagareru kieyuku wata no kumo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:31.39,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Holding out both hands, I stretch out in the falling leaves\N{\i1}Ryoote wo age ah senobi shita rakuyou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:51.69,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}As the house lights come on, I wish to meet people smiling at each other\N{\i1}Akari tomoru mado waraiau hito ni aitai to omou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.69,0:24:05.82,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Believing in a miraculous enounter{meeting} to become real, I shout out for love\N{\i1}Sou kanau hazusa kiseki no deai ni ai sakenda
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:25.78,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Luminous lives meet and bond with each other\N{\i1}Kagayaku jinsei no meguriawase tsumuideyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:41.81,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s keep on living our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei wo tayumazu ni susumi tsuzukeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.81,0:25:02.43,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s begin the story of our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei no monogatari wo saa hajimeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:59.08,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1278,736)}Kodai {\3c&H000000&}Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NSaijo Miki :\NKato Saburo:\NKato Makoto:\NKato Tsubasa:\NShinohara Hiroki:\NYamamoto Akira: \N Sawamura Sho: \NTakuma Takeshi:\NYamazaki Susumu:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:59.08,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1298,138)}Ono Da{\3c&H000000&}isuke\NKuwashima Houko\NKenich Suzumura\NOtsuka Hochu\NMugihito\NAkabane Kenji \NMoriya Satomi \NHosoya Yoshimasa\NSato Rina\NTakamori Natsumi \NHirakawa Daisuke \NTanaka Rie \NShikaki  Yuya \NKijima Koichi \NTsuchida Hiroshi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:04.93,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1280,554)}{\3c&H000000&} Saito Hajime:\NNagakura Shiori:\NKurata Masaru:\NTodo Saki:\NHijikata Ryu: \NYamanami Osamu:\NTodo Heikuro:\NSerizawa Kotetsu\NOperator:
