Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.44,0:25:37.52,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Now young Desler, choose your future.{make a choice for the future.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:39.19,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Shoot, Ranhalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.19,0:25:43.19,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Death is not the hardest thing for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:44.82,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,If you don't choose, what's the point ?!{What's the point, if you can't choose ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:46.75,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Don't ! You shouldn't choose !{, you must not choose.}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:47.26,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kodai !
